~ start
if WorldState.has_flag("offering_delivered")
	{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: The Seal of the O shines upon the obedient, dear.
	=> END
elif WorldState.has_flag("quest_offering_accepted")
	{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: Ah. {{Cast.short("maren")}}'s little offering. Set it by the icons.
	- Place the offering
		do WorldState.set_flag("offering_delivered", true)
		{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: See how easy? The Covenant loves an easy girl.
		{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: ...That was a compliment, dear.
	- First — a question about the Fourteenth.
		{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: Questions. How... modern of you.
		{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: Set it down anyway, there's a love.
		do WorldState.set_flag("questioned_ritual", true)
		do WorldState.set_flag("offering_delivered", true)
	=> END
elif WorldState.has_flag("refused_offering")
	{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: I heard you told {{Cast.full("maren")}} "no thank you."
	{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: What a fascinating phrase. We'll be watching your cycle with interest.
	=> END
{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: Welcome, initiate. The Queen Mothers see all who wish to be seen.
{{Cast.full("ondine")}}: And all who don't, of course. That's rather the point of Them.
=> END
